      "concrete_trigger": "After line 520 successfully taskkills the recorded descendant and lines 528-531 observe it absent, the operating system can reuse descendant_pid before the finally block at lines 550-554. _cleanup_pids then treats any process at that numeric PID as the fixture process and invokes taskkill /PID <pid> /T /F. The same PID-only finalizer is also used by the slow-success and lost-handle cases.",
